{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "ac7e4d413418fb8817f907a97d65f00072cd2e812c693fd3e53106bb73ef6dba", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事", "zh": "写真摄影的工作", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7000_place", "source_sha256": "313024cdcccd0144b755aa97de0be84fc462be68158ac5400a3426fd4b08ed90", "ja": "怪しげな部屋", "zh": "可疑的房间", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7001_p", "source_sha256": "2836042c7551777dc7a21aceafe7b505d7899e3386ab996aa0e551af2c91f72a", "ja": "（雪歩はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の仕事で、\n『スケルトンが怖いスケルトン』をテーマに撮影する）", "zh": "（雪步要为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄以“害怕骷髅的骷髅”为主题的照片）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "836d124d36ac9e38f89fe33a2910dcd7363ee92d49b491555d9e1487df6bd063", "ja": "自分もモンスターで仲間なのに、\nスケルトンが怖いなんて変な感じですぅ……。", "zh": "明明我自己也是怪物，和它还是同伴，却害怕骷髅，感觉好奇怪呀……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7003_p", "source_sha256": "6247b9467106cb3893bf690d2bb44bb3efd6be90240b1e90fb4c1f7a5785b2a8", "ja": "怖がりなモンスターがいてもいいんじゃないか？\nもしかしたら自分の姿を知らないだけかもしれないし。", "zh": "就算是胆小的怪物，也没什么不可以吧？说不定只是因为不知道自己长什么样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "92899848c4e4f67ce30d27a01a52e7eb6197ae8265c9c72ae05971ad2057440c", "ja": "た、確かに……自分の姿が分からなかったら、私も\n人間を怖いと思っちゃったりするのかも……？", "zh": "确、确实……如果不知道自己的样子，我也可能会觉得人类很可怕……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16ec0dc23a4cbd4ef8fdbb3a571441ea78a4bd0ac4e59becd01b2e35dfd3636c", "ja": "なんだか、ちょっと気持ちが分かった気がしますぅ！\nで、でも、怖がるところの撮影ってどうやったら……。", "zh": "总觉得，我好像有点明白那种心情了呢！  \n但、但是，要怎么拍摄害怕的样子呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7006_p", "source_sha256": "d32cdb5db6ee6eead6f2d8cf3b086dc151223acfdbc3af49369218482e4af541", "ja": "そうだな……自分がどんな状況で怖がっているのか\n考えておく、とかどうだろう。たとえば……。", "zh": "这样啊……不如先想想，自己是在什么情况下感到害怕的。比如……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7007", "source_sha256": "e2093648b6ec6a16f7fdf8fe7e83691ae445a06cbc6f50d5caa553b3e28bc547", "ja": "鏡を見て驚く", "zh": "照镜子时吓了一跳", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7008", "source_sha256": "8028959ed2de1d3fe609b3c3484c2b7d31ddc3b305853e9d43d4b94a8b335bd5", "ja": "退魔グッズを使う", "zh": "使用驱魔道具", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7200_p", "source_sha256": "36f4715df2061af238f496ba8451891441ba4028153fe62e9e589fdcdd808e1c", "ja": "自分の姿を知らないなら、鏡を見ただけで\n驚いて怖がってしまうかもしれないな。", "zh": "要是不知道自己的模样，光是看到镜子\n可能就会吓得害怕起来了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7201_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5b9bf151e5c89890453dd83f845fffa77ea50853c534aa4251d14388f5a9e903", "ja": "な、なるほど……。そのときのスケルトンの気持ちは\nわかる気がするので……うまくできそうです。", "zh": "原、原来如此……我好像能理解那时骷髅的心情……应该能演好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7202_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9ceb0d27753a17be9d116c5fa30e94237e0f9d70e4fa164037ef9da83b24a9ad", "ja": "よし……自分を見て驚くスケルトン、やってみます！\n頑張るので、見ていてくださいね。", "zh": "好……看到自己而吓了一跳的骷髅，我来试试看！\n我会努力的，请好好看着我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7300_p", "source_sha256": "36f4715df2061af238f496ba8451891441ba4028153fe62e9e589fdcdd808e1c", "ja": "自分の姿を知らないなら、鏡を見ただけで\n驚いて怖がってしまうかもしれないな。", "zh": "要是不知道自己的模样，光是看到镜子\n可能就会吓得害怕起来了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7301_004yuk", "source_sha256": "24b0287a3aa12d76af632bde96506a801927feb7dd824be9a353e5d47154b773", "ja": "わ、わかりますぅ！　初めて見るもの、それも\n骨だけなんてとっても怖いですよね……。", "zh": "我、我明白的！第一次看到的东西，而且还是一副骨头，真的会特别可怕呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7302_004yuk", "source_sha256": "abbc4334e3abecd0a86b8c2f7b1d2e3bf5e43dc2386559f9e53c9f1d8a88e387", "ja": "うぅ……リアルに考えていたら、\n胸が痛くなってきちゃいました……。", "zh": "呜呜……一认真去想，就觉得胸口开始痛起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7500_p", "source_sha256": "f994d61e174ba7d4ef7b5764b31dcc18cfcf9b01b3f101f579015418b26e8805", "ja": "他のスケルトンが近寄ってくるのが怖いから、\n退魔グッズを使ってる状況なんてどうだ？", "zh": "设定成因为害怕其他骷髅靠近，\n所以正在使用驱魔道具的情境怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7501_004yuk", "source_sha256": "be38e7c052e2a478af1192440ad91b3c26596d3c316cbe821628a8f9f5d9bf61", "ja": "わぁ、すごい……！！　心底モンスターを怖がっている\n気持ちが、伝わってくる気がしますぅ！", "zh": "哇，好厉害……！！感觉能真切感受到那种发自内心害怕怪物的心情呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7502_004yuk", "source_sha256": "953342b4c250fce2ba8d3ed05b000a5d8ec53385cfd007d76c8cd0a3412d6fff", "ja": "このグッズで、絶対にモンスターを近寄らせない……\nそんな強い意志で私も撮影に挑んでみますぅ！", "zh": "用这些周边，绝对不让怪物靠近……\n我也要抱着这样的坚定决心，努力完成拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7600_p", "source_sha256": "f994d61e174ba7d4ef7b5764b31dcc18cfcf9b01b3f101f579015418b26e8805", "ja": "他のスケルトンが近寄ってくるのが怖いから、\n退魔グッズを使ってる状況なんてどうだ？", "zh": "设定成因为害怕其他骷髅靠近，\n所以正在使用驱魔道具的情境怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7601_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5da9b88d21b2253067f470222cf68f681b93f32eb60132fb7e84a7ed8c68b3e7", "ja": "なるほど、退魔！　退魔……。あ、あの。\n私もスケルトンですよね……？", "zh": "原来如此，退魔！退魔……那个，我也是骷髅吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_004yuk_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_004yuk_7602_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ad0206e5db19054cf94d9d0141a5e7215291d391a29e6ae90be13814479b4f77", "ja": "そ、それって、自分にも効いて、消滅しちゃったり\nしないんでしょうか……？　はううぅ。", "zh": "那、那种东西也会对自己起效，让自己消失吗……？呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
